WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:17.085
Magician: Is Mittens ready for the magic trick?

2
00:00:17.086 --> 00:00:19.020
Sarah: I think so.

3
00:00:19.021 --> 00:00:24.094
You won't cut her in half, will you?

4
00:00:24.095 --> 00:00:32.701
Magician: Oh no! I'm going to make her disappear.

5
00:00:32.702 --> 00:00:34.984
Sarah: Will you bring her right back?

6
00:00:34.985 --> 00:00:40.010
Magician: Of course.

7
00:00:40.011 --> 00:00:42.765
Now is everyone ready?

8
00:00:42.766 --> 00:00:46.100
Kids: Yes!

9
00:00:46.101 --> 00:00:50.039
Magician: Hocus-pocus!

10
00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:53.160
Now you see the cat.

11
00:00:53.161 --> 00:00:57.915
Now you don't!

12
00:00:57.916 --> 00:01:02.942
Ben: Mittens is gone!

13
00:01:02.943 --> 00:01:05.639
Theo: How did you do that?

14
00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:10.681
Magician: Ah, I cannot give away my magic secrets!

15
00:01:10.682 --> 00:01:12.908
Sarah: I hope Mittens is okay.

16
00:01:12.909 --> 00:01:15.639
She's not used to disappearing.

17
00:01:15.640 --> 00:01:17.733
Magician: Do not worry.

18
00:01:17.734 --> 00:01:21.577
I will now make Mittens reappear.

19
00:01:21.578 --> 00:01:34.067
Magician: Hocus-pocus! Cat, come back!

20
00:01:34.068 --> 00:01:36.856
Riley: Where is she?

21
00:01:36.857 --> 00:01:39.144
Ben: I don't see her.

22
00:01:39.145 --> 00:01:43.060
Sarah: What happened? Is Mittens okay?

23
00:01:43.061 --> 00:01:47.380
Magician: Hmm . . . Let me try again.

24
00:01:47.381 --> 00:01:51.546
Magician: Hocus-pocus, one, two, three.

25
00:01:51.547 --> 00:01:56.822
Mittens will now come to me!

26
00:01:56.823 --> 00:02:01.443
Skyler: I still don't see her.

27
00:02:01.444 --> 00:02:04.367
Magician: My trick seems to have gone wrong.

28
00:02:04.368 --> 00:02:06.791
Sarah: What do you mean?

29
00:02:06.792 --> 00:02:14.992
Magician: Well, ah . . . I don't know what happened to Mittens.

30
00:02:14.993 --> 00:02:17.942
Magician: Umm . . . I've got to go now.

31
00:02:17.943 --> 00:02:20.673
I have another magic show to do.

32
00:02:20.674 --> 00:02:26.115
Magician: Good-bye, everyone!

33
00:02:26.116 --> 00:02:28.869
Sarah: But what about Mittens?

34
00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:31.546
Can you get her back again?

35
00:02:31.547 --> 00:02:35.909
Magician: I'm afraid I don't know how.

36
00:02:35.910 --> 00:02:39.462
Theo: But I thought you knew how to do magic!

37
00:02:39.463 --> 00:02:42.677
Magician: I know how to do tricks.

38
00:02:42.678 --> 00:02:45.644
But something went wrong this time.

39
00:02:45.645 --> 00:02:47.540
Magician: I'm sorry, Sarah.

40
00:02:47.541 --> 00:02:53.679
Mittens is really gone!
